1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:01,910
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:03,510
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,510 --> 00:00:05,140
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:07,880
(Episode 44)

5
00:00:28,570 --> 00:00:32,240
(Joo Ae Sook's Baby (F)
Sept. 11, 2000, 11:05 p.m., 3.28kg)

6
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:42,680
In case seeing these gifts...

7
00:00:43,010 --> 00:00:46,550
makes you miss
Manager Na Tae Hoon too badly,

8
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:50,760
I also brought along
a recorded message from him.

9
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:53,690
We're not in any danger right now,

10
00:00:54,590 --> 00:00:58,030
but we should be prepared
for when we're backed into a corner.

11
00:01:00,470 --> 00:01:02,430
When the investigation closes in,

12
00:01:03,130 --> 00:01:05,040
you should wrap things up here...

13
00:01:05,240 --> 00:01:07,110
and leave Korea.

14
00:01:12,510 --> 00:01:16,010
Manager Na went
above and beyond for me.

15
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:19,080
I understood after listening
to the recording.

16
00:01:20,020 --> 00:01:22,950
It became clear why he had no choice
but to write that suicide note.

17
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:26,760
Don't tell me...

18
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:29,230
you actually believe all of this.

19
00:01:30,930 --> 00:01:32,500
Is there any reason I shouldn't?

20
00:01:34,170 --> 00:01:36,770
If you listen to an edited recording
taken out of context,

21
00:01:37,070 --> 00:01:39,770
sure, you could easily
misunderstand.

22
00:01:40,710 --> 00:01:41,810
Is that so?

23
00:01:42,170 --> 00:01:44,440
I don't think calling it
a misunderstanding quite cuts it.

24
00:01:45,940 --> 00:01:46,950
Above all...

25
00:01:48,950 --> 00:01:51,820
Manager Na, you're my accomplice.

26
00:01:55,520 --> 00:01:57,620
The word accomplice
caught my attention.

27
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:01,090
Being an accomplice...

28
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:06,330
probably refers to what happened
to Eun Seol's mother.

29
00:02:13,570 --> 00:02:14,570
As expected,

30
00:02:15,140 --> 00:02:17,110
Manager Na didn't commit
the crime alone.

31
00:02:18,110 --> 00:02:19,110
Team Leader Seo,

32
00:02:20,210 --> 00:02:22,380
do you think
you can pin this on me...

33
00:02:23,150 --> 00:02:25,020
with just this pathetic recording?

34
00:02:25,550 --> 00:02:27,390
Manager Na made all of this up.

35
00:02:27,820 --> 00:02:29,320
The dead can't speak,

36
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:31,490
so the living must dig
for the truth.

37
00:02:32,260 --> 00:02:33,890
Did he really make all of this up,

38
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:37,400
or was he framed and murdered?

39
00:02:42,330 --> 00:02:43,470
Given the circumstances,

40
00:02:44,300 --> 00:02:45,540
Manager Na's death...

41
00:02:46,340 --> 00:02:48,170
doesn't look like
a clear-cut suicide.

42
00:02:54,850 --> 00:02:56,350
The deaths
of both Eun Seol's mother...

43
00:02:57,950 --> 00:02:59,220
and Manager Na...

44
00:03:00,690 --> 00:03:01,750
lead back to one person.

45
00:03:03,190 --> 00:03:05,290
You, Director Joo.

46
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:11,200
Well, what can you do about it?

47
00:03:12,700 --> 00:03:15,100
Since you've been digging
into my background,

48
00:03:16,170 --> 00:03:18,600
you must know what Eun Seol and I
are to each other.

49
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:32,350
Since you don't seem to like
the gift I prepared,

50
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:34,520
I'll take it back.

51
00:03:40,190 --> 00:03:41,460
And I'm warning you.

52
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:45,030
Don't approach Eun Seol anymore.

53
00:03:46,530 --> 00:03:48,070
I should be the one saying that.

54
00:03:48,930 --> 00:03:51,770
She's finally living a normal life
like everyone else,

55
00:03:51,900 --> 00:03:54,440
so don't torment her
by opening old wounds.

56
00:03:54,770 --> 00:03:56,980
Regardless of the pain
Eun Seol might suffer,

57
00:03:57,740 --> 00:04:01,950
you'll pay for your crimes.
I'll make sure of it.

58
00:04:05,250 --> 00:04:08,620
Sure, keep looking, Team Leader Seo.

59
00:04:13,790 --> 00:04:16,260
Get back to me
when you find something stronger...

60
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:20,570
than this pathetic recording.

61
00:04:22,030 --> 00:04:23,800
Be careful not to get in
over your head, though.

62
00:04:40,820 --> 00:04:42,120
Tae Hoon, that jerk.

63
00:04:43,220 --> 00:04:44,960
He stabbed me in the back after all?

64
00:04:56,270 --> 00:04:58,570
I wondered
where that birth bracelet went.

65
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:01,810
So he swiped it and stashed it away?

66
00:05:03,010 --> 00:05:04,240
Since it's come to this,

67
00:05:04,310 --> 00:05:07,210
Seo Hyun Jae will think
I'm Ko Eun Seol's biological mother.

68
00:05:07,780 --> 00:05:11,120
That means he'll be hesitant
to tell her the truth for now.

69
00:05:19,060 --> 00:05:20,630
(Cheongma)

70
00:05:21,330 --> 00:05:24,400
Well, what can you do about it?

71
00:05:25,660 --> 00:05:28,030
Since you've been digging
into my background,

72
00:05:29,100 --> 00:05:31,700
you must know what Eun Seol and I
are to each other.

73
00:05:36,510 --> 00:05:38,280
Using the excuse of being
Eun Seol's biological mother,

74
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:41,850
you're just going to hide
behind her?

75
00:05:47,250 --> 00:05:48,320
Hey, you came.

76
00:05:48,750 --> 00:05:50,960
- Right.
- Come on in.

77
00:05:51,790 --> 00:05:53,830
What's this about all of a sudden?

78
00:05:57,930 --> 00:05:59,660
You came here by yourself, right?

79
00:06:00,060 --> 00:06:01,070
Yes.

80
00:06:01,970 --> 00:06:03,530
Attorney Seo, is something up?

81
00:06:04,770 --> 00:06:05,900
Not exactly.

82
00:06:07,340 --> 00:06:09,910
By any chance, did Director Joo
say anything to you?

83
00:06:10,610 --> 00:06:11,780
Director Joo?

84
00:06:14,050 --> 00:06:17,050
Just that she enjoyed the interview
and that I did a good job.

85
00:06:17,380 --> 00:06:18,850
That was about it.

86
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:21,120
What else?

87
00:06:22,050 --> 00:06:23,820
She didn't say much besides that.

88
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:29,960
I see.

89
00:06:30,390 --> 00:06:33,130
If Director Joo
ever approaches you first,

90
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:36,070
please pass along whatever she says
to me. Okay?

91
00:06:36,530 --> 00:06:38,500
Yes, I will.

92
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:41,640
Is that why you called me here?

93
00:06:43,940 --> 00:06:45,340
That's part of it.

94
00:06:45,710 --> 00:06:47,250
Please have a seat first.

95
00:06:51,150 --> 00:06:54,550
I just wanted to see if you ran
into any issues after the interview.

96
00:06:54,890 --> 00:06:58,460
Your face is out there now.
Has anyone recognized you yet?

97
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:01,090
There have been a few people
who recognized me.

98
00:07:01,230 --> 00:07:03,130
Even on my way to work today,
an older woman told me...

99
00:07:03,190 --> 00:07:04,530
to hang in there.

100
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:07,730
Still, if things ever get tough,
let me know.

101
00:07:08,870 --> 00:07:10,130
I guess I should show you.

102
00:07:11,100 --> 00:07:13,440
You know my legs
are super long, right?

103
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:18,310
I'm on call 24 hours a day,

104
00:07:18,380 --> 00:07:20,580
so call your Daddy Long Legs
anytime.

105
00:07:21,150 --> 00:07:24,050
Right, a 24-hour free hotline.

106
00:07:25,450 --> 00:07:26,720
Seriously.

107
00:07:30,090 --> 00:07:31,090
Ko Eun Seol.

108
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:32,790
You're pretty good
at taking pictures.

109
00:07:33,390 --> 00:07:36,060
I know, I'm quite good at it.

110
00:07:37,090 --> 00:07:38,630
You did take good photos,

111
00:07:38,700 --> 00:07:40,700
but isn't that mostly thanks
to the model?

112
00:07:41,130 --> 00:07:42,500
I'm truly remarkable.

113
00:07:45,270 --> 00:07:46,540
That being said,

114
00:07:46,970 --> 00:07:48,910
since you have
a great sense of style,

115
00:07:48,970 --> 00:07:50,440
could you help me plan
my engagement party?

116
00:07:51,610 --> 00:07:53,850
You know how slammed Seok Jin is.

117
00:07:54,380 --> 00:07:57,110
That's why the team offered
to help out.

118
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:02,650
With the engagement party?

119
00:08:02,850 --> 00:08:03,860
Yes.

120
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,020
Ji Soo...

121
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:07,460
will look into
the floral arrangements,

122
00:08:07,660 --> 00:08:10,330
and Young Ung will check on
the menu for the event.

123
00:08:11,030 --> 00:08:13,930
As part of the team, shouldn't you
pitch in with something too?

124
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,670
What should I help with?

125
00:08:22,110 --> 00:08:23,510
As for you...

126
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:26,940
Right, that would be perfect.

127
00:08:27,410 --> 00:08:30,750
Since you have such great taste
as a designer,

128
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:33,920
why don't you help Seok Jin and me
pick out our outfits...

129
00:08:33,990 --> 00:08:35,590
and our matching rings?

130
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:38,990
Isn't that typically
a wedding planner's job?

131
00:08:38,990 --> 00:08:40,490
That's true for weddings,

132
00:08:40,730 --> 00:08:42,090
but this is an engagement party.

133
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:44,900
So I'm just asking my own team
for a bit of help.

134
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,200
Can't I do that?

135
00:08:47,570 --> 00:08:48,570
What's wrong?

136
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:51,070
Are you still uncomfortable
because of Seok Jin?

137
00:08:52,370 --> 00:08:55,040
No. I'll do it.

138
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,470
Good.

139
00:08:56,540 --> 00:08:58,680
You must have sorted out
those childish feelings by now.

140
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:00,180
Why would you be uncomfortable?

141
00:09:01,710 --> 00:09:04,250
Anyway, thank you all so much.

142
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:07,150
After the engagement party,
I'll treat you big time.

143
00:09:09,350 --> 00:09:10,520
Sorry, everyone.

144
00:09:11,020 --> 00:09:13,360
The manufacturing team meeting
dragged on, so I got held up a bit.

145
00:09:14,430 --> 00:09:15,560
Let's start the meeting.

146
00:09:20,100 --> 00:09:21,270
Seo Hyun Jae.

147
00:09:21,330 --> 00:09:23,730
I can't just sit back
and let him run wild.

148
00:09:24,900 --> 00:09:27,670
Did something happen that day?

149
00:09:28,040 --> 00:09:30,610
I found the fabricated evidence
that Manager Na planted.

150
00:09:31,310 --> 00:09:32,540
Fabricated evidence?

151
00:09:33,810 --> 00:09:35,280
I told you.

152
00:09:36,250 --> 00:09:37,520
Manager Na was trying to frame me...

153
00:09:37,580 --> 00:09:40,120
for the murder
of Ko Eun Seol's mother.

154
00:09:41,490 --> 00:09:42,920
Then what should we do?

155
00:09:44,660 --> 00:09:49,030
First, we need to warn Seo Hyun Jae
so he stops running wild.

156
00:09:50,030 --> 00:09:52,830
I guess we should send
some people to scare him.

157
00:10:00,140 --> 00:10:02,070
I sent you his contact information,
so check it.

158
00:10:04,410 --> 00:10:06,540
Send some guys over there
and just scare him a little.

159
00:10:07,210 --> 00:10:09,380
You want him
a little shaken up, right?

160
00:10:09,780 --> 00:10:10,780
Yes.

161
00:10:11,850 --> 00:10:14,390
I heard he has an older sister
and a nephew.

162
00:10:15,090 --> 00:10:17,150
If you can't get to him,
try them instead.

163
00:10:17,660 --> 00:10:20,360
Still, he won't be as easy to handle
as An Guk Cheol.

164
00:10:20,490 --> 00:10:22,030
Since he's a lawyer,

165
00:10:22,090 --> 00:10:25,060
he probably knows exactly
how these things work.

166
00:10:26,500 --> 00:10:29,000
Do I look like someone
who can't even calculate that much?

167
00:10:32,100 --> 00:10:33,100
I apologize.

168
00:10:33,970 --> 00:10:37,140
Secretary Choi, you just need
to set the stage as instructed.

169
00:10:37,510 --> 00:10:39,040
I'll handle the rest.

170
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:41,850
Yes, I understand.

171
00:11:02,970 --> 00:11:05,970
Like spooking him a little
is going to fix this.

172
00:11:07,300 --> 00:11:09,210
I need to clean up
the mess properly.

173
00:11:10,810 --> 00:11:12,980
Secretary Choi,
you just scare him and back off.

174
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:16,780
I'll take care of the rest.

175
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:20,950
(Head of Legal Affairs,
Seo Hyun Jae)

176
00:11:23,790 --> 00:11:27,290
I need to figure out Manager Na's
and Director Joo's whereabouts...

177
00:11:27,490 --> 00:11:29,560
on the day of the incident first.

178
00:11:37,900 --> 00:11:39,100
That will be difficult.

179
00:11:39,900 --> 00:11:41,740
Really? Then could I see...

180
00:11:41,740 --> 00:11:43,840
the investigation report
for the Na Tae Hoon case?

181
00:11:44,340 --> 00:11:47,850
Hyun Jae, I can't help you anymore.

182
00:11:48,680 --> 00:11:49,680
I'm sorry.

183
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:59,490
You did the right thing.

184
00:12:00,690 --> 00:12:02,790
Even if your friend is a lawyer,

185
00:12:02,830 --> 00:12:07,200
you can't just hand over
personal information like this.

186
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:09,570
Right, of course.

187
00:12:11,100 --> 00:12:15,310
Leaking official secrets
and violating privacy laws?

188
00:12:16,270 --> 00:12:19,510
Even as a detective,
you won't walk away clean.

189
00:12:20,580 --> 00:12:23,650
If that comes to light,
you'd be handing over...

190
00:12:24,580 --> 00:12:26,480
that detective badge on the spot.

191
00:12:26,750 --> 00:12:28,250
Please look the other way
just this once.

192
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:30,720
This will never happen again.

193
00:12:31,820 --> 00:12:32,860
Of course.

194
00:12:33,490 --> 00:12:34,560
It shouldn't.

195
00:12:35,830 --> 00:12:36,830
Thank you.

196
00:12:41,030 --> 00:12:42,030
Then,

197
00:12:42,770 --> 00:12:46,500
I'll trust that this
will not happen again.

198
00:12:56,010 --> 00:12:58,780
(Head of Legal Affairs,
Seo Hyun Jae)

199
00:13:08,790 --> 00:13:09,890
What's that?

200
00:13:11,060 --> 00:13:12,960
Ms. Kang's engagement ring.

201
00:13:14,400 --> 00:13:15,400
What?

202
00:13:16,130 --> 00:13:17,540
Why are you looking at that?

203
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,770
I agreed to help her look into it.

204
00:13:20,070 --> 00:13:21,940
Is going that far really necessary?

205
00:13:22,870 --> 00:13:24,940
Isn't this a clear abuse of power?

206
00:13:25,710 --> 00:13:29,980
This is nothing.
I just consider it part of the job.

207
00:13:31,650 --> 00:13:32,650
Then what would it take...

208
00:13:33,020 --> 00:13:35,950
for you to get angry
at how unfair it is?

209
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:39,090
When I feel like I'm losing
who I am.

210
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,790
At work,

211
00:13:43,860 --> 00:13:45,400
you end up having to bend
to someone else's will,

212
00:13:45,460 --> 00:13:47,300
even if it means compromising
your own values.

213
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,600
I'd never do something like that,

214
00:13:50,070 --> 00:13:51,500
no matter who orders me to.

215
00:13:52,800 --> 00:13:55,940
These small errands
are easy enough to just do as told.

216
00:13:56,740 --> 00:13:59,240
But I will never do anything...

217
00:13:59,580 --> 00:14:00,950
that compromises who I am.

218
00:14:02,980 --> 00:14:04,350
No matter what orders I'm given,

219
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:08,950
I need to judge right from wrong
without betraying my conscience.

220
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:26,900
Shouldn't you be heading home?

221
00:14:27,970 --> 00:14:29,570
I was about to.

222
00:14:36,810 --> 00:14:37,880
Wait, is this...

223
00:14:38,220 --> 00:14:39,780
the design for my engagement ring?

224
00:14:40,180 --> 00:14:41,190
Yes.

225
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:44,020
Ms. Kang asked for my help,
so I was working on it.

226
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:47,390
Are you really doing this
just because she told you to?

227
00:14:47,490 --> 00:14:48,490
Yes.

228
00:14:48,890 --> 00:14:51,000
The whole team is pitching in.

229
00:14:51,460 --> 00:14:52,460
Ko Eun Seol.

230
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,800
Even if you're new
to the corporate world,

231
00:14:54,870 --> 00:14:56,170
shouldn't you at least know
the difference here?

232
00:14:57,740 --> 00:14:59,970
None of this is necessary,
so pack up and head home.

233
00:15:02,870 --> 00:15:04,070
Why should I?

234
00:15:06,210 --> 00:15:08,280
Young Ung headed
to the venue meeting,

235
00:15:08,350 --> 00:15:10,450
and Ji Soo went off
to hire the florist.

236
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:13,220
Just like
you're getting mad at me now,

237
00:15:13,380 --> 00:15:15,690
did you say the exact same thing
to both of them?

238
00:15:15,750 --> 00:15:17,350
That's not
what's important right now.

239
00:15:17,350 --> 00:15:20,960
And, if you think
things like this are unfair,

240
00:15:21,260 --> 00:15:23,390
please bring it up officially...

241
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:24,830
during the meeting.

242
00:15:40,280 --> 00:15:41,280
Boss,

243
00:15:41,710 --> 00:15:43,650
how about a glass of beer together
after closing?

244
00:15:44,080 --> 00:15:45,080
No, thanks.

245
00:15:45,150 --> 00:15:46,820
And have your grandma
bite my head off again?

246
00:15:46,880 --> 00:15:48,450
If you want to drink beer,
drink it alone.

247
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:51,020
My grandmother only acts tough
with her words.

248
00:15:51,420 --> 00:15:52,860
She's actually very soft-hearted.

249
00:15:53,190 --> 00:15:56,360
You have no idea how much
she praises you, boss.

250
00:15:56,590 --> 00:15:58,700
I highly doubt that.

251
00:15:59,130 --> 00:16:02,330
I'd be glad if she just didn't see me
as a blood-sucking cougar.

252
00:16:03,430 --> 00:16:05,400
As if you actually bite.

253
00:16:05,470 --> 00:16:06,840
You're a cute rabbit, if anything.

254
00:16:10,970 --> 00:16:13,840
Then, let's finish
wrapping this up...

255
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:15,810
and go grab some beer.

256
00:16:15,950 --> 00:16:17,410
Just one glass, though.

257
00:16:18,150 --> 00:16:20,850
Got it. I'll finish closing up
as fast as I can.

258
00:16:34,330 --> 00:16:35,470
Today, I caught a glimpse...

259
00:16:36,130 --> 00:16:37,770
of Teun Teun
outside the kindergarten.

260
00:16:38,740 --> 00:16:39,870
He's grown so much.

261
00:16:41,340 --> 00:16:43,870
I'll wait outside your place.
Let's talk for a minute.

262
00:17:00,760 --> 00:17:02,630
Let's take a rain check
on that beer.

263
00:17:04,260 --> 00:17:05,260
Why?

264
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:10,300
I'm just way too tired.
Rain check, okay?

265
00:17:16,710 --> 00:17:17,980
Is it because of Teun Teun?

266
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:22,110
That guy from before...
He's Teun Teun's dad, right?

267
00:17:23,210 --> 00:17:26,180
What are you doing?
Give me my phone.

268
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:30,050
If you're wavering, don't.

269
00:17:30,850 --> 00:17:33,420
And especially for Teun Teun's sake,
don't let him sway you.

270
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:35,130
Excuse me?

271
00:17:35,430 --> 00:17:36,660
While Teun Teun was growing up,

272
00:17:36,730 --> 00:17:38,460
you said he never reached out once.

273
00:17:39,300 --> 00:17:41,500
I'd hate to have
a dad like that, too.

274
00:17:41,870 --> 00:17:44,570
Whoever I'm torn over,
what's it to you?

275
00:17:45,270 --> 00:17:47,200
I don't want to care either,

276
00:17:47,270 --> 00:17:48,910
but what can I do
when I can't help it?

277
00:17:50,370 --> 00:17:52,840
It's none of your business,
so please just...

278
00:17:53,980 --> 00:17:55,410
Stop acting like you know anything.

279
00:17:55,410 --> 00:17:57,350
Does it really have nothing
to do with me?

280
00:18:00,020 --> 00:18:02,950
Are you telling me
to stay out of your business, boss?

281
00:18:06,220 --> 00:18:07,220
Yes.

282
00:18:07,830 --> 00:18:08,990
Stay out of my business.

283
00:18:14,830 --> 00:18:15,830
Fine.

284
00:18:17,230 --> 00:18:18,540
I'll do that.

285
00:18:28,250 --> 00:18:29,310
Don't wait for me.

286
00:18:29,750 --> 00:18:32,020
And don't ever show up
in front of us again.

287
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,900
Does it really have nothing
to do with me?

288
00:18:57,270 --> 00:18:58,280
Yes.

289
00:18:58,810 --> 00:19:00,010
Stay out of my business.

290
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:06,920
Fine.

291
00:19:08,150 --> 00:19:09,520
I'll do that.

292
00:19:26,040 --> 00:19:27,100
Mi Rae?

293
00:19:28,110 --> 00:19:29,610
You've seemed a bit down lately.

294
00:19:30,140 --> 00:19:31,140
Is something up?

295
00:19:31,310 --> 00:19:32,380
Of course not.

296
00:19:33,140 --> 00:19:34,210
Get some rest.

297
00:19:34,650 --> 00:19:36,580
If it's because of his grandma,

298
00:19:37,150 --> 00:19:39,120
should I speak to her formally?

299
00:19:39,950 --> 00:19:40,950
What?

300
00:19:40,980 --> 00:19:44,420
Don't be like that
and just tell his grandma.

301
00:19:44,690 --> 00:19:46,360
Tell her you want to date Eun Guk.

302
00:19:47,090 --> 00:19:50,130
How long are you going to waste time
and exhaust your emotions?

303
00:19:50,790 --> 00:19:52,900
It seems like Eun Guk
has feelings for you too.

304
00:19:53,100 --> 00:19:55,130
Seo Hyun Jae,
I said you've got it wrong.

305
00:19:55,600 --> 00:19:58,800
First his grandmother, now you.
Why are you doing this to me?

306
00:19:59,470 --> 00:20:00,470
All right.

307
00:20:00,570 --> 00:20:02,710
I just assumed
that you had feelings for him too.

308
00:20:03,140 --> 00:20:04,840
I told you I don't,

309
00:20:04,910 --> 00:20:07,110
so why do you keep pushing me
and getting on my nerves?

310
00:20:07,180 --> 00:20:08,650
I said I don't!

311
00:20:10,250 --> 00:20:11,450
Don't you believe me either?

312
00:20:12,280 --> 00:20:15,350
Of course I believe you.
All right, I was wrong.

313
00:20:15,620 --> 00:20:17,150
I completely misunderstood.

314
00:20:17,290 --> 00:20:20,290
Don't make assumptions about me
just because I'm a single mom.

315
00:20:20,390 --> 00:20:22,790
Do you think I'm easy enough
to fall for just any man?

316
00:20:24,830 --> 00:20:25,900
I'm sorry, Mi Rae.

317
00:20:25,960 --> 00:20:28,730
Forget it.
You're just like everyone else.

318
00:20:29,700 --> 00:20:30,730
Mi Rae...

319
00:20:32,670 --> 00:20:34,770
(Cheongma)

320
00:20:35,240 --> 00:20:38,340
Congratulations on getting
the scholarship program approved.

321
00:20:39,710 --> 00:20:42,450
Since it's the first
scholarship program you planned,

322
00:20:42,710 --> 00:20:44,650
everyone seems to have
high expectations.

323
00:20:45,150 --> 00:20:46,150
Right.

324
00:20:46,380 --> 00:20:49,490
Thanks to Eun Seol's interview,
public opinion is favorable,

325
00:20:49,620 --> 00:20:51,320
so I feel less pressure.

326
00:20:51,690 --> 00:20:53,320
Even so,

327
00:20:54,120 --> 00:20:57,130
expectations and results
are two different things.

328
00:20:57,930 --> 00:21:01,700
You'll have to prove yourself
with actual results, right?

329
00:21:02,130 --> 00:21:06,170
As it's the first project led
by a Chairman who's an ex-actress,

330
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:09,170
the entertainment world
will be watching closely, too.

331
00:21:10,510 --> 00:21:12,280
I'll have to show them results.

332
00:21:12,510 --> 00:21:16,280
That's how I'll imprint on them
that I'm the one...

333
00:21:16,380 --> 00:21:18,080
meant to lead Cheongma.

334
00:21:20,250 --> 00:21:21,280
Right.

335
00:21:22,190 --> 00:21:25,190
But it won't be easy.

336
00:21:26,320 --> 00:21:29,790
Even I, who started from the bottom,
sometimes struggle like this.

337
00:21:30,260 --> 00:21:32,260
Since you lack hands-on experience,

338
00:21:32,530 --> 00:21:33,900
it'll probably be harder on you.

339
00:21:36,200 --> 00:21:38,700
I see why you're struggling.

340
00:21:41,910 --> 00:21:45,680
Hands-on experience alone
isn't enough to lead a company.

341
00:21:45,980 --> 00:21:48,810
At the end of the day,
running a business...

342
00:21:49,080 --> 00:21:52,220
is about connecting
with people's hearts, isn't it?

343
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:55,720
In that regard,
I think I'm one step ahead of you.

344
00:21:57,650 --> 00:22:01,430
Well, go ahead and try it yourself.

345
00:22:01,830 --> 00:22:04,830
It won't be as easy as you think.

346
00:22:04,900 --> 00:22:09,700
Yes, more than anyone else,
I want your recognition.

347
00:22:10,100 --> 00:22:12,370
So just sit back and watch.

348
00:22:19,080 --> 00:22:20,080
Mom.

349
00:22:21,140 --> 00:22:22,150
Mom?

350
00:22:22,510 --> 00:22:23,880
Where did she go this time?

351
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:32,720
(Ko Eun Seol Wins Grand Prize
at Cheongma Designer Competition)

352
00:22:32,790 --> 00:22:34,020
(Ko Eun Seol's First Day,
"Discrimination Controversy")

353
00:22:34,090 --> 00:22:35,160
(Cheongma Shoejoy Contest:
Kang Hae Ra vs. Ko Eun Seol)

354
00:22:36,330 --> 00:22:37,330
Darn.

355
00:22:37,490 --> 00:22:39,800
Those mindless women sitting around,

356
00:22:39,860 --> 00:22:41,970
spouting such useless nonsense.

357
00:22:42,500 --> 00:22:45,800
Wait, what's got you
so worked up this time?

358
00:22:46,370 --> 00:22:47,770
At the supermarket,

359
00:22:47,840 --> 00:22:49,610
a bunch of mindless women
gathered around...

360
00:22:49,670 --> 00:22:52,580
and started talking trash
about our Eun Seol.

361
00:22:52,680 --> 00:22:55,480
So, I taught them a lesson.

362
00:22:58,550 --> 00:22:59,580
Hold on.

363
00:23:00,050 --> 00:23:02,520
Why are you snooping
through my stuff?

364
00:23:02,950 --> 00:23:04,320
What? Mom,

365
00:23:04,590 --> 00:23:06,790
have you been keeping
these news clippings?

366
00:23:07,660 --> 00:23:09,430
Where did you find this?

367
00:23:09,630 --> 00:23:11,360
You should've told me.

368
00:23:11,630 --> 00:23:14,630
Eun Seol would've been
so happy to see this.

369
00:23:15,130 --> 00:23:18,400
Why would I show her this?
These are for my eyes only.

370
00:23:18,670 --> 00:23:20,200
Seriously, Mom.

371
00:23:20,770 --> 00:23:22,810
You really are
the ultimate "tsundere."

372
00:23:22,970 --> 00:23:25,180
What was that? Cinder?

373
00:23:25,880 --> 00:23:27,210
As in Cinderella's stepmother?

374
00:23:27,410 --> 00:23:29,780
There you go again,
hearing only what you want to hear.

375
00:23:30,210 --> 00:23:33,920
Not Cinderella's stepmother,
but a "tsundere."

376
00:23:33,920 --> 00:23:35,520
It means on the outside,

377
00:23:35,620 --> 00:23:38,190
you're cold
like Cinderella's stepmother,

378
00:23:38,320 --> 00:23:39,320
but on the inside,

379
00:23:39,390 --> 00:23:41,320
you secretly care
with a lot of affection.

380
00:23:42,090 --> 00:23:44,360
It is a word used for people
exactly like you.

381
00:23:44,860 --> 00:23:46,800
You might act all cranky
in front of Eun Seol...

382
00:23:48,230 --> 00:23:49,570
I mean, grumble.

383
00:23:50,430 --> 00:23:52,640
But in front of others,

384
00:23:52,870 --> 00:23:54,970
you can never stand people
badmouthing her.

385
00:23:55,110 --> 00:23:56,340
How could I stand that?

386
00:23:56,740 --> 00:23:59,110
I can badmouth my own granddaughter,

387
00:23:59,180 --> 00:24:01,550
but I'll not tolerate
others doing it.

388
00:24:01,680 --> 00:24:05,320
Then try being a little warmer
to Eun Seol, too.

389
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:08,690
Enough nonsense, let's just eat.

390
00:24:08,990 --> 00:24:09,990
Do we have side dishes?

391
00:24:10,290 --> 00:24:12,120
- You make them.
- Oh, okay.

392
00:24:13,560 --> 00:24:15,260
- Mom.
- Let's go.

393
00:24:15,760 --> 00:24:18,330
Have you thought of a way
to lure out Team Leader Seo?

394
00:24:18,860 --> 00:24:21,500
Yes, I've already coordinated
with the detective.

395
00:24:22,230 --> 00:24:24,400
Good, and the rest?

396
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:27,000
Based on the flow of movement
inside the warehouse,

397
00:24:27,000 --> 00:24:28,340
I've finalized
the positioning as well.

398
00:24:28,810 --> 00:24:30,640
We need to pull this off flawlessly
on the first try.

399
00:24:31,210 --> 00:24:32,510
Without causing a scene.

400
00:24:33,380 --> 00:24:34,980
Yes, I'll keep that in mind.

401
00:24:38,010 --> 00:24:41,220
It's time we get moving.
You're dismissed.

402
00:25:13,580 --> 00:25:14,890
At work,

403
00:25:15,020 --> 00:25:16,650
you end up having to bend
to someone else's will,

404
00:25:16,720 --> 00:25:18,390
even if it means compromising
your own values.

405
00:25:19,390 --> 00:25:20,490
I'd never do something like that,

406
00:25:21,190 --> 00:25:22,490
no matter who orders me to.

407
00:25:23,930 --> 00:25:26,000
But I will never do anything...

408
00:25:26,760 --> 00:25:28,030
that compromises who I am.

409
00:25:30,130 --> 00:25:31,300
No matter what orders I'm given,

410
00:25:32,500 --> 00:25:36,010
I need to judge right from wrong
without betraying my conscience.

411
00:25:42,980 --> 00:25:45,950
Is it right to keep Eun Seol
in the dark like this?

412
00:25:47,250 --> 00:25:50,550
At this rate, Director Joo will
approach Eun Seol first.

413
00:25:53,060 --> 00:25:54,090
Before that happens,

414
00:25:54,090 --> 00:25:56,660
I've got to tell Eun Seol the truth
about who Ms. Joo really is first.

415
00:25:58,460 --> 00:26:00,730
(Head of Legal Affairs,
Seo Hyun Jae)

416
00:26:00,730 --> 00:26:01,730
Right.

417
00:26:09,340 --> 00:26:10,340
Eun Seol.

418
00:26:10,410 --> 00:26:12,680
Attorney Seo, you haven't left yet?

419
00:26:12,940 --> 00:26:14,880
I was hoping to walk out with you.

420
00:26:15,480 --> 00:26:16,550
I also have something to tell you.

421
00:26:17,050 --> 00:26:19,320
Sure, I was just about to leave too.

422
00:26:19,520 --> 00:26:21,820
- Just a moment.
- Take your time.

423
00:26:27,290 --> 00:26:28,290
Hyun Jae,

424
00:26:28,330 --> 00:26:31,730
I managed to get
that Na Tae Hoon file you requested.

425
00:26:32,200 --> 00:26:33,930
I'll give them to you in person.

426
00:26:38,130 --> 00:26:39,140
You ready to go?

427
00:26:39,670 --> 00:26:41,070
I'm sorry about this.

428
00:26:42,110 --> 00:26:44,410
Something urgent just came up
that requires my attention.

429
00:26:45,180 --> 00:26:47,810
I'm sorry, but go ahead
and head home first today.

430
00:26:48,240 --> 00:26:49,650
That's fine,

431
00:26:50,510 --> 00:26:52,320
but didn't you have something
to tell me?

432
00:26:52,780 --> 00:26:54,650
I did, but...

433
00:26:56,920 --> 00:26:58,390
I'll tell you another time.

434
00:26:59,920 --> 00:27:03,030
Sure, we see each other
every day after all.

435
00:27:04,130 --> 00:27:05,160
That's true.

436
00:27:33,590 --> 00:27:34,660
I'm here.

437
00:27:39,730 --> 00:27:41,060
Where is he?

438
00:27:50,910 --> 00:27:52,010
The phone is turned off.

439
00:27:52,140 --> 00:27:53,840
You are being connected
to voicemail.

440
00:27:53,980 --> 00:27:55,280
After the beep...

441
00:27:59,320 --> 00:28:00,350
Mr. Seo Hyun Jae.

442
00:28:07,360 --> 00:28:08,360
Hey, get him.

443
00:28:28,140 --> 00:28:29,210
Wait.

444
00:28:32,820 --> 00:28:34,880
Yes, Director. We're working on it.

445
00:28:38,120 --> 00:28:39,120
Director Joo.

446
00:28:40,720 --> 00:28:44,090
You're nothing but trash
that stoops to this level.

447
00:28:48,830 --> 00:28:49,830
You'll end up...

448
00:28:50,870 --> 00:28:53,440
as another one of her accomplices.

449
00:28:57,340 --> 00:28:58,340
Then,

450
00:28:59,910 --> 00:29:00,980
you'll eventually...

451
00:29:02,910 --> 00:29:04,110
meet your end...

452
00:29:05,480 --> 00:29:07,720
at her hands just like Manager Na.

453
00:29:39,780 --> 00:29:42,350
Rough him up,
but leave him breathing.

454
00:29:42,490 --> 00:29:43,490
Got it.

455
00:29:44,450 --> 00:29:45,920
I'll finish up and report back.

456
00:30:16,550 --> 00:30:18,220
- Move out.
- Got it.

457
00:30:33,440 --> 00:30:35,640
As you instructed,
we knocked him out...

458
00:30:35,970 --> 00:30:37,070
and wrapped things up.

459
00:30:50,750 --> 00:30:52,320
Where are you going
dressed like that, Director?

460
00:30:53,320 --> 00:30:54,960
I still have some stuff to wrap up.

461
00:30:55,830 --> 00:30:56,830
At this hour?

462
00:30:57,030 --> 00:30:59,160
It bothers me
if I leave things half-done.

463
00:31:01,000 --> 00:31:03,570
Spoken like a workaholic.
I admire that.

464
00:31:04,400 --> 00:31:05,940
I'm tired,
so I'm going to head upstairs.

465
00:31:07,140 --> 00:31:08,200
Sweet dreams.

466
00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:17,880
That's it.

467
00:31:19,320 --> 00:31:20,550
Just sleep peacefully.

468
00:31:22,320 --> 00:31:25,260
I'll be the one to do
all the dirty work.

469
00:32:09,100 --> 00:32:10,100
Team Leader Seo.

470
00:32:11,730 --> 00:32:12,740
They say...

471
00:32:14,370 --> 00:32:16,110
people who are too nosy...

472
00:32:16,940 --> 00:32:19,910
have short lives.

473
00:32:21,640 --> 00:32:25,110
You should've lived
a little more selfishly.

474
00:32:28,280 --> 00:32:29,890
When you get to the afterlife,

475
00:32:30,420 --> 00:32:32,520
rest in peace.

476
00:33:41,620 --> 00:33:45,500
(A Trap Called Desire)

477
00:33:45,560 --> 00:33:47,700
A man in his 30s was found dead,

478
00:33:47,760 --> 00:33:49,330
and the police have launched
an investigation.

479
00:33:49,430 --> 00:33:51,770
What should we do about dinner
with the directors tomorrow?

480
00:33:51,830 --> 00:33:53,470
You made plans too?

481
00:33:53,570 --> 00:33:54,870
You did too?

482
00:33:54,970 --> 00:33:57,010
I suppose it'll all be decided
this time around.

483
00:33:57,110 --> 00:33:59,140
Are you really that against
Seok Jin and me getting engaged?

484
00:33:59,140 --> 00:34:00,780
Why? Why do you hate it?

485
00:34:00,840 --> 00:34:02,550
You must want Seok Jin to be happy.

486
00:34:02,550 --> 00:34:06,380
You have no idea how shocked I was
to hear about Team Leader Seo.

487
00:34:06,580 --> 00:34:09,590
The day he died,
he told me he had something to say.

488
00:34:09,720 --> 00:34:11,220
I'm going to find out what it was.

489
00:34:11,320 --> 00:34:12,920
Even if it weren't for what you did,

490
00:34:12,920 --> 00:34:14,720
that was ultimately
Seo Hyun Jae's fate.

491
00:34:14,790 --> 00:34:17,860
Even so,
you should've been more careful.

492
00:34:18,590 --> 00:34:20,600
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
